Package: blockr.graph
Title: A Directed Acyclic Graph Plugin for 'blockr'
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R:
    c(person(given = "Nicolas",
             family = "Bennett",
             role = c("aut", "cre"),
             email = "nicolas@cynkra.com"),
      person(family = "Bristol Myers Squibb",
             role = "fnd"))
Description: Provides a plugin that draws a 'blockr' board as a directed
    acyclic graph in the browser. The graph shows the blocks of the board,
    the links between them and the stacks that group them. Edits made in the
    graph go through the command registry of 'blockr.core', as all edits of
    the board do.
